5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I believe it would be prudent to look at the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns to see what truly delivers.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I will examine the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments and crew strength to assess the available human resources.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I'll look into the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities, as well as the incident logs on shared instrumentation, to gauge current capacity.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I think I shall examine the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers, along with the national computing agreement and facility day rates, to clarify the current cost landscape.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I'll check the station records from partner field sites and the national repository deposit turnaround to see where potential delays might occur.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
